        "title": "In many countries, students leave high school without understanding how to manage their money. Why is this? What solutions can be suggested to help students manage their finances effectively? ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GoJ7dlZNCoESdjxlp5KluJLGgJS\"><em><strong>In many countries, students leave high school without understanding how to manage their money. Why is this? What solutions can be suggested to help students manage their finances effectively?&nbsp;</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Students' lack of financial management skills&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tu0SddWcDoz931xKri8lpq8Wgxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề&nbsp;<em>Students' lack of financial management skills </em>cho 1 xu hướng:&nbsp;</strong>Ở nhiều quốc gia, học sinh rời trường trung học m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng hiểu c&aacute;ch quản l&yacute; tiền bạc.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ct2UdtYdhoby7Nxrd2SlZFGAgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời 2 c&acirc;u hỏi trực tiếp:&nbsp;<em>Tại sao điều n&agrave;y xảy ra? C&oacute; thể đề xuất giải ph&aacute;p g&igrave; để gi&uacute;p học sinh quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh hiệu quả?</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRaBdsLuZoP0rUxH5FWly8vXgUb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i <em>Students' lack of financial management skills</em>&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvxLdkWg2o1TemxUMSJlS50eguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TS3PdFFE4ooFjlx0jselldGTgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O66RdEdiuoAwdBxsDMPlxpn0gCd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">manage their personal finances&nbsp;<em>(quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh c&aacute; nh&acirc;n)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7yrdcTO5oqFcXxj2eulMHpUgdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JsabdjYrpoeNLgx2I7glvIXKgfe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NHondlQHQoSvFwxo2qRljImZgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n khiến học sinh thiếu kỹ năng quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3xqd9C33ot9ZExvD6el2ifBgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Đề xuất c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p để gi&uacute;p học sinh quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh hiệu quả hơn</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n khiến học sinh thiếu kỹ năng quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5tQdQOeaoe8mMxQ5UklAxSJgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>C&oacute; hai nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh khiến giới trẻ thiếu kỹ năng quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7iId6hhwoyuHZxjXJ5l19sfgKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAgHdsdjDohJbvxNORLlgQBqg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:&nbsp;</strong>Thứ nhất, c&aacute;c trường học <em>thường qu&aacute; ch&uacute; trọng v&agrave;o những m&ocirc;n học thuật (place excessive emphasis on academic subjects) </em>như to&aacute;n, khoa học v&agrave; văn học nhằm chuẩn bị cho học sinh bước v&agrave;o <em>c&aacute;c kỳ thi tuyển sinh đại học (university entrance exams)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZexDdV8ppoE82kxisQPlQ71Ag0e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:&nbsp;</strong>V&igrave; vậy, học sinh <em>d&agrave;nh phần lớn thời gian cho những m&ocirc;n n&agrave;y (devote the majority of their time to these subjects)</em> v&agrave; tốt nghiệp m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; bất kỳ kiến thức thực tế n&agrave;o về c&aacute;ch tiết kiệm hay chi ti&ecirc;u hợp l&yacute;. Điều đ&oacute; đồng nghĩa với việc ngay cả <em>những học sinh c&oacute; th&agrave;nh t&iacute;ch cao (high-achieving students)</em> cũng c&oacute; thể gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc lập ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng th&aacute;ng khi bắt đầu sống tự lập.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrwCd0yJMo0jNUxFNvNlWLcfg1e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs9bdaafkoRCYVxqvhOlBBh7gLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> Thứ hai, nhiều bậc phụ huynh <em>tr&aacute;nh trao đổi với con c&aacute;i về vấn đề tiền bạc (avoid discussing money matters)</em> v&igrave; cho rằng t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; chuyện nhạy cảm hoặc ri&ecirc;ng tư trong gia đ&igrave;nh</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZXVdOwYboLow7xjqDRlYMmVgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Do đ&oacute;, trẻ em lớn l&ecirc;n m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng hiểu những kh&aacute;i niệm cơ bản như <em>lập ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch (budgeting)</em> hay tiết kiệm. Khi bắt đầu tự kiếm thu nhập, c&aacute;c em dễ <em>chi ti&ecirc;u qu&aacute; mức (overspend)&nbsp;</em>hoặc <em>rơi v&agrave;o cảnh nợ nần (fall into debt)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: Đề xuất c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p để gi&uacute;p học sinh quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh hiệu quả hơn</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMDNd3MH4oKzDpxutSSl4mMegvh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, c&oacute; một số giải ph&aacute;p hiệu quả để giải quyết vấn đề n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhRSdel6LoOHtWxhOaHllMpKg9d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0XddwQJBoLl6YxsgWvlneqvgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> C&aacute;ch đầu ti&ecirc;n l&agrave; phụ huynh n&ecirc;n chủ động cho con tham gia v&agrave;o <em>c&aacute;c hoạt động lập kế hoạch chi ti&ecirc;u của gia đ&igrave;nh (family budgeting activities)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7izdK6wjo64yOxA6F6lS0Y6gLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>Chẳng hạn, họ c&oacute; thể để con c&ugrave;ng l&ecirc;n kế hoạch cho c&aacute;c <em>khoản chi h&agrave;ng th&aacute;ng (monthly household expenses)</em> như tiền mua thực phẩm hay<em> h&oacute;a đơn điện nước (utility bills)</em>, từ đ&oacute; gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c em c&oacute; <em>trải nghiệm thực tế trong việc quản l&yacute; tiền bạc (hands-on experience with managing money)</em> trong một m&ocirc;i trường quen thuộc v&agrave; an to&agrave;n. Theo thời gian, th&oacute;i quen n&agrave;y sẽ gi&uacute;p trẻ <em>h&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh &yacute; thức tr&aacute;ch nhiệm đối với việc chi ti&ecirc;u của bản th&acirc;n (develop a sense of responsibility towards their own spending)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKdBd2jDColbB2xUgeJl0rQMgNe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Một giải ph&aacute;p kh&aacute;c l&agrave; c&aacute;c trường học n&ecirc;n tổ chức <em>những buổi hội thảo xoay quanh kỹ năng quản l&yacute; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (workshops centered around financial management)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong>V&iacute; dụ, nh&agrave; trường c&oacute; thể x&acirc;y dựng <em>c&aacute;c m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh chợ giả lập (simulated markets)</em>, nơi học sinh thực h&agrave;nh mua b&aacute;n v&agrave; lập ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch bằng <em>tiền tưởng tượng (fake currency)</em>. C&aacute;ch học n&agrave;y sẽ khiến kiến thức về t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh trở n&ecirc;n sinh động v&agrave; đ&aacute;ng nhớ hơn nhiều so với những b&agrave;i học chỉ mang t&iacute;nh l&yacute; thuyết</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUnRdmwHoomd0bx3B9xl3s1Agte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2nCdFhyUoQul9xqlgXlr4PKgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">the lack of financial literacy <em>(sự thiếu kiến thức về kinh tế)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">education system's heavy focus on academics <em>(việc hệ thống gi&aacute;o dục qu&aacute; tập trung v&agrave;o học thuật)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">parents' reluctance to discuss money at home <em>(sự e ngại của phụ huynh khi n&oacute;i về tiền bạc trong gia đ&igrave;nh)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3530,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>In many countries, a large number of students complete their high school education without acquiring any understanding of how to manage their personal finances. This issue can be attributed to certain shortcomings in both the education system and family upbringing, and there are practical measures that can be implemented to address it.</p>",
            "question_id": 44075,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3531,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>There are two primary reasons why young people lack financial management skills.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">First, schools tend to place excessive emphasis on academic subjects such as mathematics, science, and literature in order to prepare students for university entrance exams. As a result, students devote the majority of their time to these subjects and graduate without any practical knowledge about saving or spending wisely, meaning that even high-achieving students may struggle with creating a monthly budget once they begin living independently.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Second, many parents avoid discussing money matters with their children, as they consider finances to be a sensitive or private family topic. Consequently, children grow up without understanding basic concepts like budgeting or saving, and when they start earning their own income, they are more likely to overspend or fall into debt.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 44075,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3532,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, there are several effective solutions to tackle this problem.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">One approach is for parents to actively involve their children in family budgeting activities. For instance, they can let young people help plan monthly household expenses such as groceries or utility bills, giving them hands-on experience with managing money in a familiar and supportive environment. Over time, this habit would help children develop a sense of responsibility towards their own spending. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Another solution is for schools to organize workshops centered around financial management. For example, schools could create simulated markets where students practice buying, selling, and budgeting with fake currency. This would make learning about finance far more engaging and memorable for students compared to purely theoretical lessons.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 44075,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3533,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, the lack of financial literacy among high school students largely stems from the education system's heavy focus on academics and parents' reluctance to discuss money at home. To address this, both parents and schools should take an active role in teaching young people practical money management skills.</p>",
            "question_id": 44075,
